    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This is phenomenal work! Ch'en snuck into an alley to save the trapped Mizuki, and followed it by directly confronting all the other competitors there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems the other teams have determined LUNG wRATh is too dangerous to keep around, and have all silently accorded to work together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "But even so, Ch'en isn't cowed one bit, choosing to take up the fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "A battle to absolutely revel in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But we can't forget about the other side of the alley, where Lin battles too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Unlike Ch'en's teeth-gritting clash in the alleyway, Lin's spared only a few moves to hold down the entrance, and deter any team who dares come.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there anyone in this whole championship who can overcome this combination's mere presence?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha ha, goes to show they do work when they each fight their own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Missy, if Ch'en and Miss Lin fought, who do you think'd win?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm interested, y'know. Put two really powerful guys together, and who wouldn't wanna know who the stronger is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Only you'd think like that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't know anyway. It's the first time I've seen this woman fight in years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Weren't you and Miss Lin buddy-buddy? Weird you never got to see this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's buddies with who? She plays at that mystery, 24/7. There's times she doesn't even answer the phone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "And who says you've seen someone fight just 'cause you know them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's fair enough, I guess that's just me being used to Ch'en. If she wanted to win now, I'd be out of luck banking on just her swordplay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not everyone's got the same dynamic as you two.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, it's a good thing I haven't seen it. I worry the day I do, I'll be trying to arrest her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Makes sense. She's the Rat King's daughter, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, still can't say so, though. He's not a bad egg or anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "When I was a fresh dumbass in Lungmen...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Save it. I've met the Rat King before, you know. I don't need you telling me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, as long as you get it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget that, you just used the word 'dumbass,' didn't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at me, using vulgar language in front of Milady. Oughta slap me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So you and Ch'en have seen how she takes fights?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, I'm here because I haven't. Neither has Ch'en, I reckon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right about one thing, though. It's a good thing we've never seen her fight before. That'd put us in the tough position, we'd have to take her in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as you get it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Never thought there'd be a day when she and Ch'en work together, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really do see everything as you get older.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "So in the end, who do you think would win, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't feel like guessing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, then I'll guess on my own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "In my opinion, if Ch'en had her sword, it'd be hard for Lin Y\u00fchsia to ever get near her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, if she does let Miss Lin get near, then Ch'en's lost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch'en sure sucks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't say that either. Ch'en's solid with her kickboxing. Joint locks and grapples and whatever. She's amazing with all our normal training, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw how decent her accuracy was too, just now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in the end, Ch'en's best with a sword.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're implying Lin Y\u00fchsia's as good in close-quarters as Ch'en is with her sword.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "More or less.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
