        "tag": "largebg"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_20_G02"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Having fun acting the hero, Hui-chieh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not really, but I don't need you worrying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Miss Ch'en, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you, you could've just waited over there for me. You did fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for helping me out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're welcome.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But, um, why did you do it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No reason. I saw you, so I helped.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. You're a nice person, Miss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And since you're nice, here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_486_espumo_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this... pure gold?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm, they were only after me because I had this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_486_espumo_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're fine giving it to us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright, I can go look for some more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, I never really cared about the competition anyway. Getting to know someone as nice as Miss Ch'en is enough for me already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll give you a heads-up. Quite a few teams are on high alert\u2014you can chat all you want, but you'd better not stay here too long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm heading off, then. Bye-bye~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'd better move too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I just ask, did you get anything out of that other than playing hero?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Does gold not count?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing in particular.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, continue? Or hand in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll continue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
